{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1239,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3386c7fe097423709f58b176",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈──哈哈哈！\r\n看啊，我这个霸王的华丽跑法！\r\n尽管崇拜我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2ac6149f58c927ab227bf1dd78987c6a9d9f9d53b4e0465bb44c1d115aadfa9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b45b3af49a238d5a068855c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是……何种黑暗阻挡在前……\r\n喝！我都会绽放光芒的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7808fe3523f662bb8a808dcea0cadbefbf288fa0d4e6ac6632ea12b53a31f41c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c048b88d02c93321f791d0e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样啊！\r\n这就是开辟霸王值得庆贺的\r\n新年与新时代的一幕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d6ca0451af902b3658eceb725cd8e1464db42189f0b6162a39f74baabc56ef6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6505074fa59c2b7eec8bc1f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一飞冲天吧！要比日出还高！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68c462ffbe98e816f68ae3a29c85d539803f695649c69888697087897f992630",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f313f602a68a181cb80531a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宝船出航吧！啊啊！我这个太阳一飞冲天！\r\n新年快乐────！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58e8ccc03ca3de559091f3754983165d4825eb31b603dacbca0f00e924e3cb88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06b6dac0cfc3bd14bca4b596",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，陶醉在我的光芒之中吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56a958d6e74f3e59d3975ebe86aac5ee3c0da5a1a2eca2a19088890f3d24a172",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:228f30af44dad2037d1a7b16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "至高无上的时光将要揭幕了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00f18d0f2ad1bf428b29677c749bddb4733a10849bd0ad532da1d50f863c1678",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8976fb6484f5f4d38d1d60a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今后也继续看着我缔造传说吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "861618711cc0b8eeed3783acfbf07717f95aa4c18e793da18fafd8b8e78877a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0729e103eb4370521633f135",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如今回想起来……\r\n和你的相遇就是\r\n一切命运的开端吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5c86118fc9c5c9a6452976bc651aba3c4d26acd2d977726b255dac0b4be9cae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d7550506546d68edcafba15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套服装相当适合学园这个舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c874ab58330495445492f615613b794d0aedfe6fa39e7e42842b94d7c447745",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1900e0ecab3be60f0c56988",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊，我听见了……观众在呼唤我的声音！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f39923c5efea5b1a0660f5c81c5b51d47228f1001447d0b89fb16dc7a8da9b69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bfc513ce4abf4663ce92f5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好见识一下「霸王」的光辉吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff8a38ff2a29c4f5e973d84c985012788f2cf3f69ad2ee618d94b7ec54c0f866",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ea026aa951131c9f320e020",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管穿什么服装都耀眼动人……\r\n啊啊，我实在太可怕了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c64b918d5ab18118abe85980dfa7dd2f6c2064f8f4dfcb9649949297a591499",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d94ad56ae4c842a748a7f37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不论是什么样的舞台，\r\n最耀眼的人都会是我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a412121fb3e7f6b359920a457a7eb3e3da70ea5d26c7c4068dd5f521fcd86e44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c35890fe79cfed58a12550f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要当心一点，\r\n以免被闪瞎了双眼……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58d6e8122cdbe18b3cc8678212d1b176e0395de36eedb638a90794b6b4a46b74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:649a30f1b4a44d16762fb4e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，穿上和服的我也很华丽……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a3f83c8935539e27ba735a73676e686dcc53a915005add62b6ecb8b5266357b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b46c4ebc353cbf0dc109fe9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔，你是在祈求霸王的保佑吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d21b41123bab827844e364440f09e44b56e444a943c965e9f4ca957e14ed09f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:886fef519e3bada412519007",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我真是太美了……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a809b44f254bdf7920178113d2f186d4ede0a7b994da93cb4c53ac1c2eaaa2ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b28a06eeb2a8bd63e3151209",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好见识一下「霸王」的实力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "feae9844a7a172e64ee1a97c80044aee14f6ddbf08d22be7b8ba87dff4a9a0a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6a37ba0a96198bff846b735",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早着替えは主役の嗜みさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5de547f08c11d9b4944c4e5689c9ddda792b9a159155ed37457fd164ce069d68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeb6c8bbeda60dbd79b2f375",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どの道もボクが歩けば花道さ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9449ad648a2254f564138394159753689dedf8df3fba5cbc88e2f569b685c5d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47d652e573c93ead65998a61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套服装相当适合学园这个舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c874ab58330495445492f615613b794d0aedfe6fa39e7e42842b94d7c447745",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1085c1a252d4f807c31d4ad4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊，我听见了……观众在呼唤我的声音！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f39923c5efea5b1a0660f5c81c5b51d47228f1001447d0b89fb16dc7a8da9b69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
